WEBVTT

00:09.413 --> 00:10.896
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.896 --> 00:12.689
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:12.689 --> 00:14.137
- I CAN'’T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:14.137 --> 00:15.965
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:15.965 --> 00:19.103
- ♪ OHH... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:19.103 --> 00:21.241
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:21.241 --> 00:23.379
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:23.379 --> 00:25.275
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:25.275 --> 00:27.172
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:27.172 --> 00:29.310
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:29.310 --> 00:31.344
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:31.344 --> 00:33.379
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:33.379 --> 00:35.137
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:35.137 --> 00:37.206
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:37.206 --> 00:39.137
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.137 --> 00:41.137
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:41.137 --> 00:42.344
- SPONGEBOB
- 海绵宝宝

00:42.344 --> 00:44.655
SQUAREPANTS!
方裤！

00:44.655 --> 00:47.103
[laughing]
[笑]

00:47.103 --> 00:49.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:49.413 --> 00:50.448
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

01:04.034 --> 01:06.275
- CAN I HELP YOU?
- 我可以帮你吗？

01:06.275 --> 01:07.862
- YEAH.
- 是的。

01:07.862 --> 01:09.793
OH, LET'’S SEE HERE.
哦，让我们看看这里。

01:09.793 --> 01:14.241
I HAVE A QUESTION
ABOUT THE KRABBY KIDDIE MEAL.
我有一个问题
关于蟹蟹儿童餐。

01:14.241 --> 01:19.689
IS IT REALLY,
REALLY, REALLY CUTE?
真的吗，
真的、真的很可爱吗？

01:19.689 --> 01:21.344
- ADORABLE.
- 可爱。

01:21.344 --> 01:24.344
- CUTER THAN
A REGULAR KRABBY PATTY?
- 比更可爱
普通的蟹肉饼？

01:24.344 --> 01:26.310
- YES.
- PSSST!
- 是的。
- 嘘！

01:26.310 --> 01:28.482
PATRICK,
GET THE KRABBY KIDDIE MEAL.
帕特里克，
来一份蟹蟹儿童餐吧。

01:28.482 --> 01:31.068
LOOK, A REGULAR
KRABBY PATTY HERE.
看，一个普通的
蟹肉饼在这里。

01:31.068 --> 01:33.103
A KRABBY KIDDIE PATTY HERE.
这里有一个蟹蟹小馅饼。

01:33.103 --> 01:36.344
30% CUTER,
AND IT ONLY COSTS $1 MORE.
可爱30%，
只需多花费 1 美元。

01:36.344 --> 01:38.000
- OH!
OH, YEAH!
- 哦！
哦，是啊！

01:38.000 --> 01:38.172
YEAH, YEAH, YEAH!
I WANT THAT!
是啊，是啊，是啊！
我想要那个！

01:43.103 --> 01:46.827
- THAT'’LL BE $4.99.
- 那是 4.99 美元。

01:46.827 --> 01:49.068
- IS THIS ENOUGH?
- 这够了吗？

01:49.068 --> 01:50.241
- NO.
- 不。

01:50.241 --> 01:51.448
- SORRY, PATRICK.
- 对不起，帕特里克。

01:51.448 --> 01:53.000
- OH, CRUD!
- 哦，CRUD！

01:53.000 --> 01:55.965
THAT'’S EVERYTHING I GOT!
这就是我得到的一切！

01:55.965 --> 01:57.275
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

01:57.275 --> 01:59.000
- I HAVE AN IDEA.
- 我有一个主意。

01:59.000 --> 02:00.896
WE CAN BUY IT TOGETHER
AND SHARE IT.
我们可以一起购买
并分享。

02:00.896 --> 02:02.620
- SHARE IT?
- SURE.
- 分享吗？
- 当然。

02:02.620 --> 02:05.482
YOU SEE, SHARING
IS THE MOST WONDERFUL--
你看，分享
最精彩的是——

02:05.482 --> 02:07.931
- YEAH, YEAH, YEAH.
- 是啊，是啊，是啊。

02:07.931 --> 02:12.620
I'’M FAMILIAR
WITH THE CONCEPT OF SHARING.
我很熟悉
秉承分享的理念。

02:12.620 --> 02:14.551
ding!
叮！

02:14.551 --> 02:17.655
SHARING IS FUN!
分享很有趣！

02:17.655 --> 02:18.896
HUH, SPONGEBOB?
嗯，海绵宝宝？

02:18.896 --> 02:20.827
- OH, YEAH.
- 哦，是的。

02:20.827 --> 02:22.965
- [grinding sound]
- [研磨声]

02:22.965 --> 02:24.655
- ARE YOU GONNA SAVE
SOME OF THAT FOR ME?
- 你要救吗
给我一些？

02:24.655 --> 02:26.689
- WHAT?
- NOTHING.
- 什么？
- 没有什么。

02:26.689 --> 02:29.379
- HEY, WHERE'’S THE TOY?
- 嘿，玩具在哪里？

02:29.379 --> 02:30.965
- OH, IT DOESN'’T COME
WITH A TOY.
- 哦，它不会来
带着玩具。

02:30.965 --> 02:32.344
- WHAT?
THAT'’S A RIP-OFF!
- 什么？
那是骗人的！

02:32.344 --> 02:34.103
I WANT MY MONEY BACK.
我想要回我的钱。

02:34.103 --> 02:35.275
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

02:35.275 --> 02:37.172
MONEY BACK?
退款？

02:37.172 --> 02:39.275
WHAT'’S THE PROBLEM HERE?
这里有什么问题？

02:39.275 --> 02:41.620
- MY KIDDIE MEAL
DIDN'’T COME WITH A TOY.
- 我的儿童餐
没有附带玩具。

02:41.620 --> 02:43.586
- HMM.
- 唔。

02:43.586 --> 02:45.068
AND YOU'’D LIKE TO UPGRADE
TO THE TOY PACKAGE.
并且您想要升级
到玩具包。

02:45.068 --> 02:47.103
IS THAT RIGHT?
对吗？

02:47.103 --> 02:48.655
- MR. KRABS, THE KRUSTY KRAB
DOESN'’T HAVE ANY TOYS.
- 先生。蟹肉，脆皮蟹
没有任何玩具。

02:48.655 --> 02:50.620
- OH, REALLY?
- 哦真的吗？

02:53.034 --> 02:57.413
THEN WHAT DO YOU CALL...THIS?
那你管这个叫什么？

02:57.413 --> 02:59.206
[both gasp]
[两人都喘气]

02:59.206 --> 03:01.103
- AN OFFICIAL KRUSTY KRAB
LICENSED TOY?
- 官方甲壳蟹
授权玩具？

03:10.344 --> 03:12.103
MY PURPOSE IN LIFE
我的人生目标

03:12.103 --> 03:17.275
IS TO HAVE YOU AS MY TOY.
就是把你当我的玩具。

03:17.275 --> 03:19.000
- YEESH.
- 是的。

03:19.000 --> 03:20.068
DISGUSTING.
恶心。

03:20.068 --> 03:21.896
[clears throat]
[清嗓子]

03:21.896 --> 03:23.310
YEP, IT'’S PRETTY SPECIAL,
ALL RIGHT.
是的，这很特别，
好吧。

03:23.310 --> 03:25.793
AND IT CAN BE YOURS FOR ONLY--
并且它只能属于您——

03:25.793 --> 03:26.310
ding!
叮！

03:28.793 --> 03:30.034
HEY, GOOD-LOOKING.
嘿，好看。

03:39.413 --> 03:42.586
- I LOVE YOU, OFFICIALLY
LICENSED KRABBY PATTY TOY.
- 我正式爱你
授权 Krabby Patty 玩具。

03:42.586 --> 03:45.034
NO, TOO FORMAL.
不，太正式了。

03:45.034 --> 03:47.862
I THINK I'’LL CALL YOU...
我想我会打电话给你...

03:47.862 --> 03:50.206
OH, PATTY PAL!
哦，帕蒂朋友！

03:50.206 --> 03:53.931
[laughs]
[笑]

03:53.931 --> 03:56.551
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

03:56.551 --> 03:58.827
[laughing]
[笑]

03:58.827 --> 04:00.310
- AM I INTERRUPTING?
- 我打扰了吗？

04:00.310 --> 04:01.517
- OH, HEY, PATRICK.
- 哦，嘿，帕特里克。

04:01.517 --> 04:03.103
HAVE YOU MET MY NEW TOY?
你见过我的新玩具吗？

04:03.103 --> 04:05.379
- DON'’T YOU MEAN
OUR NEW TOY?
- 你不是说
我们的新玩具？

04:05.379 --> 04:07.137
- OUR NEW TOY?
- 我们的新玩具？

04:07.137 --> 04:08.655
- IT CAME FROM THE MEAL
THAT WE'’RE...
- 它来自膳食
我们是...

04:08.655 --> 04:10.655
[clears throat]
"SHARING."
[清嗓子]
“分享”。

04:10.655 --> 04:13.344
- SHARING?
- REMEMBER?
- 分享？
- 记住？

04:13.344 --> 04:17.137
"SHARING IS THE MOST WONDERFUL
FEELING IN THE WORLD,
“分享是最精彩的
感受世界，

04:17.137 --> 04:19.758
"LIKE DANCING
WITH A MAGICAL SEA HORSE
“喜欢跳舞
与神奇的海马一起

04:19.758 --> 04:22.517
THROUGH AN ENCHANTED
KELP GARDEN."
通过魔法
海带花园。”

04:22.517 --> 04:24.620
REMEMBER THOSE WORDS,
SPONGEBOB?
记住这些话，
海绵宝宝？

04:24.620 --> 04:26.275
- I DIDN'’T SAY THAT.
- 我没这么说。

04:26.275 --> 04:29.620
BUT I GUESS
WE CAN SHARE PATTY PAL.
但我猜
我们可以分享帕蒂朋友。

04:29.620 --> 04:31.241
- [laughing]
- [笑]

04:31.241 --> 04:32.379
- NOW CAN I SEE IT AGAIN,
PATRICK?
- 现在我能再次看到它吗？
帕特里克？

04:32.379 --> 04:33.758
- WHAT?
- 什么？

04:33.758 --> 04:35.000
I THOUGHT WE WERE SHARING IT.
我以为我们正在分享它。

04:35.000 --> 04:36.793
- WHEN'’S MY TURN?
- 什么时候轮到我？

04:36.793 --> 04:38.862
- AREN'’T YOU SUPPOSED
TO BE WORKING?
- 你不应该吗
要工作吗？

04:42.689 --> 04:43.724
- [laughs nervously]
- [紧张地笑]

04:43.724 --> 04:44.724
OF COURSE.
当然。

04:47.931 --> 04:48.931
NOW IS IT MY TURN?
现在轮到我了吗？

04:48.931 --> 04:50.551
- NO.
- 不。

04:53.655 --> 04:55.068
- HOW '’BOUT NOW?
- NAH.
- 现在怎么样？
- 不。

04:55.068 --> 04:56.103
MAYBE TOMORROW.
也许明天。

04:56.103 --> 04:57.310
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

04:57.310 --> 04:58.689
NIGHT-NIGHT, PATTY PAL.
晚安晚安，帕蒂·帕尔。

04:58.689 --> 04:59.862
- NO TOUCHING!
- 禁止触摸！

04:59.862 --> 05:01.103
SEE YOU TOMORROW.
明天见。

05:04.689 --> 05:06.413
SAY GOOD NIGHT,
PATTY PAL.
说晚安，
帕蒂·帕尔。

05:06.413 --> 05:08.241
GOOD NIGHT, SPONGEBOB.
晚安，海绵宝宝。

05:10.310 --> 05:12.310
- GOOD NIGHT.
- 晚安。

05:15.034 --> 05:15.586
foomp!
噗！

05:18.413 --> 05:20.275
POOR PATRICK.
可怜的帕特里克。

05:20.275 --> 05:22.275
HE'’S ONLY GOT
THE PATTY PAL FOR TONIGHT,
他只有
今晚的小馅饼朋友，

05:22.275 --> 05:24.034
AND HE'’LL BE ASLEEP
他会睡着的

05:24.034 --> 05:25.896
AND WON'’T GET
TO PLAY WITH IT AT ALL!
并且不会得到
尽情地玩吧！

05:25.896 --> 05:27.862
[laughs]
[笑]

05:27.862 --> 05:30.862
[bouncy electronic music]
【欢快的电子音乐】

05:30.862 --> 05:38.379
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:48.379 --> 05:50.931
[foghorn blares]
[雾号声]

05:54.344 --> 05:55.379
- [yowls]
- [嚎叫]

05:55.379 --> 05:56.689
- YES!
- 是的！

05:56.689 --> 05:58.103
TODAY IS MY PATTY PAL DAY!
今天是我的帕蒂朋友日！

05:58.103 --> 06:00.000
OH, THIS IS GONNA BE FUN!
哦，这会很有趣！

06:00.000 --> 06:01.344
- [meows]
- [喵]

06:01.344 --> 06:03.137
- GARY, OF COURSE PATRICK
- 加里，当然是帕特里克

06:03.137 --> 06:04.344
WILL GIVE ME MY TURN
WITH THE PATTY PAL.
轮到我了
和帕蒂朋友一起。

06:04.344 --> 06:06.137
- [meows]
- [喵]

06:06.137 --> 06:07.965
- GARY, YOU CAN BE
A REAL NEGATIVE NANCY.
- 加里，你可以的
一个真正消极的南希。

06:09.620 --> 06:11.137
- [meows]
- [喵]

06:13.103 --> 06:14.724
- I HEARD THAT.
- 我听到了。

06:14.724 --> 06:16.413
♪ LA LA, SHARING ♪
♪ 啦啦，分享 ♪

06:16.413 --> 06:18.344
♪ DOO-DOO-DOO-DOO,
CARING ♪
♪ 嘟嘟嘟，
关怀♪

06:18.344 --> 06:20.758
♪ TAKING TURNS,
DA DOO-DOO-DOO YA CHA-CHA ♪
♪ 轮流，
哒嘟嘟嘟呀恰恰 ♪

06:20.758 --> 06:23.241
[bouncy electronic music]
【欢快的电子音乐】

06:23.241 --> 06:26.206
[knocks]
[敲门声]

06:26.206 --> 06:29.206
GOOD MORNING, PATRICK.
早上好，帕特里克。

06:29.206 --> 06:31.137
- HUH?
- 嗯？

06:31.137 --> 06:32.551
I'’M NOT HOME RIGHT NOW!
我现在不在家！

06:32.551 --> 06:34.000
PLEASE LEAVE A MESSAGE!
请留言！

06:34.000 --> 06:35.724
BEEP!
嘟！

06:35.724 --> 06:38.965
- PATRICK, IT'’S ME,
SPONGEBOB.
- 帕特里克，是我，
海绵宝宝。

06:38.965 --> 06:40.896
IT'’S MY TURN
TO PLAY WITH THE TOY.
轮到我了
玩玩具。

06:40.896 --> 06:42.448
- I CAN'’T GO OUT!
- 我不能出去！

06:42.448 --> 06:44.379
I JUST WASHED MY HAIR!
我刚刚洗了头发！

06:44.379 --> 06:46.965
- YOU DON'’T HAVE ANY--
COME ON OUT, PATRICK!
- 你没有--
出来吧，帕特里克！

06:46.965 --> 06:48.000
IT'’S MY TURN!
轮到我了！

06:48.000 --> 06:50.344
- GOT ANY I.D.?
- 有身份证吗？

06:50.344 --> 06:52.827
- I HAVE MY MILK SHAKE DISPENSER
OPERATOR'’S LICENSE.
- 我有奶昔分配器
运营商许可证。

06:52.827 --> 06:55.586
[cow moos]
[牛哞哞]

06:55.586 --> 06:57.000
- HUH.
- 嗯。

06:57.000 --> 06:58.482
LOOKS FAKE TO ME, PAL.
我觉得很假，朋友。

06:58.482 --> 07:00.344
BYE-BYE, NOW.
再见，现在。

07:00.344 --> 07:03.655
- WELL, I GUESS
I HAD BEST BE GOING.
- 嗯，我猜
我最好还是走了。

07:03.655 --> 07:06.275
I'’M WALKING AWAY.
我要走开了。

07:06.275 --> 07:07.896
HERE I GO.
我来了。

07:11.689 --> 07:13.655
I'’M GONE NOW.
我现在走了。

07:13.655 --> 07:14.758
- ARE YOU SURE?
- 你确定吗？

07:14.758 --> 07:16.172
- PRETTY SURE.
- 非常确定。

07:18.965 --> 07:20.448
HI, PATRICK!
嗨，帕特里克！

07:20.448 --> 07:22.000
TIME TO SHARE!
分享时间到了！

07:22.000 --> 07:23.310
- DECEIVER!
- 骗子！

07:23.310 --> 07:25.034
YOU DIDN'’T LEAVE AT ALL!
你根本就没有离开！

07:25.034 --> 07:26.241
- OH, AND YOU WERE WASHING
YOUR HAIR?
- 哦，你正在洗衣服
你的头发？

07:26.241 --> 07:27.241
- I WAS TOO.
- 我也是。

07:27.241 --> 07:29.793
SEE?
看？

07:29.793 --> 07:30.896
- [groans]
HEE-YUP!
- [呻吟]
嘿，是的！

07:35.310 --> 07:36.586
- NICE DISMOUNT.
- 很好的下马。

07:36.586 --> 07:37.896
- I'’VE BEEN WORKING OUT.
- 我一直在锻炼。

07:37.896 --> 07:39.034
- WELL, GOT TO GO.
- 好吧，该走了。

07:39.034 --> 07:40.379
- HOLD ON, BUSTER!
- 坚持住，巴斯特！

07:40.379 --> 07:42.448
[skidding sound]
[打滑声]

07:42.448 --> 07:44.103
HAND OVER THE TOY.
交出玩具。

07:44.103 --> 07:45.586
IT'’S MY TURN.
轮到我了。

07:45.586 --> 07:47.241
- I CAN'’T.
- 我不能。

07:47.241 --> 07:49.172
PATTY PAL AND ME
HAVE REALLY BONDED.
帕蒂·帕尔和我
真正结下了不解之缘。

07:49.172 --> 07:50.862
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

07:50.862 --> 07:52.586
OH, GARY WAS SO RIGHT
ABOUT YOU.
哦，加里说得太对了
关于你。

07:52.586 --> 07:54.206
YOU'’RE A NON-SHARER!
你是一个不分享的人！

07:54.206 --> 07:55.965
- GARY SAID THAT?
- 加里这么说？

07:55.965 --> 07:57.620
YOU'’RE OFF MY FRIEND LIST,
GARY!
你已经从我的朋友名单中删除了
加里！

07:57.620 --> 07:58.793
- [meows casually]
- [随意喵喵叫]

08:01.310 --> 08:03.103
- HAND IT OVER, PATRICK.
- 把它交给帕特里克。

08:03.103 --> 08:04.551
I GET TO PLAY
WITH THE PATTY PAL TODAY.
我开始玩了
今天和帕蒂朋友一起。

08:04.551 --> 08:06.310
- YOU CAN'’T TAKE IT.
- 你无法接受。

08:06.310 --> 08:08.275
IT'’S NOT FAIR!
这不公平！

08:08.275 --> 08:10.206
- HOW '’BOUT I ONLY TAKE IT
FOR HALF A DAY?
- 我只接受怎么样
半天？

08:10.206 --> 08:12.000
- MM-MM!
- MM-MM！
- MM-MM！
- MM-MM！
- MM-MM！
- MM-MM！
- MM-MM！
- MM-MM！

08:12.000 --> 08:13.413
- HOW '’BOUT WE TRADE OFF
EVERY HOUR?
- 我们如何权衡
每小时？

08:13.413 --> 08:14.931
- MM-MM!
- MM-MM！
- MM-MM！
- MM-MM！
- MM-MM！
- MM-MM！
- MM-MM！
- MM-MM！

08:14.931 --> 08:16.448
- EVERY HALF HOUR?
- MM-MM!
- 每半小时一次？
- MM-MM！

08:16.448 --> 08:17.862
- EVERY 15 MINUTES?
- MM-MM!
- 每 15 分钟一次？
- MM-MM！

08:17.862 --> 08:18.965
- FIVE MINUTES?
- MM-MM!
- 五分钟？
- MM-MM！

08:18.965 --> 08:20.206
- ONE MINUTE?
- 一分钟？

08:20.206 --> 08:21.413
- N-N-NO!
- 不不不！

