BY STINGY WISDOM,
- 小伙子，你被包围了
凭借吝啬的智慧，

16:43.068 --> 16:45.137
SO TRY TO PICK UP
SOME POINTERS,
所以尝试接起
一些指示，

16:45.137 --> 16:48.931
BUT WHATEVER YOU DO,
DON'’T LEND ANYONE MONEY.
但无论你做什么，
不要借钱给任何人。

16:48.931 --> 16:52.482
- 25, 26--
- 25, 26--
- 25, 26--
- 25, 26--
- 25, 26--
- 25, 26--
- 25, 26--
- 25, 26--

16:52.482 --> 16:53.689
ding!
叮！

16:53.689 --> 16:55.517
- LET'’S MINGLE.
- 让我们交流吧。

16:55.517 --> 16:57.241
[microphone feedback squeals]
[麦克风反馈尖叫声]

16:57.241 --> 16:59.275
- ATTENTION, PENNY-PINCHERS!
- 吝啬鬼们请注意！

16:59.275 --> 17:01.034
[snapping]
[啪啪啪]

17:01.034 --> 17:02.758
- WHAT? WHAT'’D HE SAY?
WHAT?
- 什么？他说什么？
什么？

17:02.758 --> 17:04.103
[snapping]
OH!
[啪啪啪]
哦！

17:04.103 --> 17:05.413
[laughter]
[笑声]

17:05.413 --> 17:07.724
- PENNY-PINCHERS.
- 吝啬鬼。

17:07.724 --> 17:09.827
- IT'’S TIME TO AWARD
THE TROPHY
- 颁奖时间到了
奖杯

17:09.827 --> 17:13.413
FOR THIS YEAR'’S
CHEAPEST CRAB.
今年的
最便宜的螃蟹。

17:13.413 --> 17:17.206
AND THE NOMINEES ARE:
被提名者是：

17:17.206 --> 17:20.241
EUGENE KRABS
IN SIGN OF THE TIMES.
尤金·克拉布斯
时代的标志。

17:22.551 --> 17:23.172
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

17:31.000 --> 17:32.862
- HUH?
- $1 PER FOOTSTEP?
- 嗯？
- 每步 1 美元？

17:32.862 --> 17:34.620
- I CAN'’T AFFORD THAT.
- 我买不起。

17:34.620 --> 17:37.241
[angry muttering]
[愤怒的嘀咕]

17:37.241 --> 17:38.448
- HOW DO I GET OUT OF HERE?
- 我怎样才能离开这里？

17:38.448 --> 17:39.689
ding! ding! ding!
叮！叮！叮！

17:39.689 --> 17:40.931
- [laughing]
- [笑]

17:40.931 --> 17:42.379
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

17:42.379 --> 17:43.896
THANK YOU.
THANK YOU.
谢谢。
谢谢。

17:43.896 --> 17:45.620
- GOOD STUFF!
- 好东西！

17:45.620 --> 17:47.758
