- JUST DISGUSTING.
- 出去。
- 真恶心。

20:10.689 --> 20:13.827
- VACATION TIME, REGULAR RAISES,
PROFIT SHARING:
- 休假时间、定期加薪、
利润分享：

20:13.827 --> 20:16.137
TO MR. KRABS,
THESE ARE JUST LITTLE GIFTS
致先生。螃蟹，
这些只是小礼物

20:16.137 --> 20:17.965
THAT HE'’S GLAD TO GIVE US
他很高兴给我们

20:17.965 --> 20:19.310
SO THAT HE CAN SEE
THE LOOK ON OUR FACES
让他能看到
我们脸上的表情

20:19.310 --> 20:20.275
WHEN HE HANDS US OUR PAYCHECK.
当他把工资交给我们时。

20:20.275 --> 20:21.758
- GAH!
- 嘎啊！

20:21.758 --> 20:23.206
- WE'’VE HEARD ENOUGH.
- 我们已经听够了。

20:23.206 --> 20:25.551
DISQUALIFIED!
取消资格！

20:25.551 --> 20:28.068
