21:27.137 --> 21:30.172
[laughter]
[笑声]

21:30.172 --> 21:31.586
[cracking]
[开裂]

21:36.931 --> 21:39.862
WELL, I DIDN'’T WIN THE AWARD,
好吧，我没有获奖，

21:39.862 --> 21:43.172
